# Auto detect text files; repo stores and checks out LF on every platform.
# Docker 镜像直接 COPY 工作区文件：统一 LF 可保证镜像内容与 Linux 服务器上的
# 数据卷字节一致，避免 dockerrun_upgrade.sh 三方合并时因换行符差异产生假冲突。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源一律不做换行符处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.ogg binary
*.ogv binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.sqlite3 binary
